1003 0 obj
  << /ActualText (3\056 Diagram Legend and Notation\nPK \050Primary Key\051\072\240Unique attribute used to identify each record in an entity table\056\nFK \050Foreign Key\051\072\240Attribute referencing a Primary Key in another entity table to establish relationship links\056\nUK \050Unique Key\051\072\240Constraint ensuring all values in the column are unique across the table\056\n1 \072 N \050One\055to\055Many\051\072\240Relationship where one record in the parent entity corresponds to multiple records in the child entity\056\n1 \072 1 \050One\055to\055One\051\072\240Relationship where one record in the parent entity corresponds to exactly one record in the child entity\056\n0\056\0561 \050Zero or One\051\072\240Optional relationship where a parent record may be associated with zero or at most one child record\056\n4\056 Entities and Attributes Description\n1\056 AIRPORT\nStores geographic and identification details of international airports\056\nairport\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique identifier for each airport\056\nairport\137name\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Official name of the airport\056\ncountry\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Country where the airport is located\056\nstate\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 State or province location\056\ncity\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 City location\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of record creation\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056\n2\056 AIRLINE\nStores information about operating airline companies\056\nairline\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique identifier for each airline\056\nairline\137code\240\050VARCHAR\054 UK\051 \055 Unique code assigned to the airline \050e\056g\056\054 IATA\057ICAO\051\056\nname\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Official commercial name of the airline company\056\ncountry\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Country of origin\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of record creation\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056\n)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 1004 0 R
