  << /ActualText (5\056 BOOKING\nStores ticket reservation information placed by passengers for specific flights\056\nbooking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique reservation ID\056\nflight\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240FLIGHT\056flight\137id\056\npassenger\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240PASSENGER\056passenger\137id\056\nstatus\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Current status \050e\056g\056\054 Confirmed\054 Cancelled\054 Pending\051\056\nbooking\137platform\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Platform used for reservation \050e\056g\056\054 Web\054 Mobile App\051\056\nticket\137price\240\050DECIMAL\051 \055 Total fare price\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of reservation creation\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056\n6\056 BOOKING\137CHANGES\137HISTORY\nAudit log entity recording historical modifications made to flight bookings\056\nchange\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique modification record ID\056\nbooking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240BOOKING\056booking\137id\056\nchange\137description\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Detailed explanation of modified attributes\056\nchanged\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of when changes were executed\056\n7\056 BOARDING\137PASS\nStores issuance details of boarding passes generated for checked\055in passengers\056\nboarding\137pass\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique boarding pass identifier\056\nbooking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\054 UK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240BOOKING\056booking\137id\240\0501\0721 constraint\051\056\nseat\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Allocated aircraft seat code\056\nboarding\137time\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Scheduled boarding time\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of pass generation\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056\n8\056 BAGGAGE\nHolds information on checked luggage registered under specific flight bookings\056\nbaggage\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique luggage item ID\056\nbooking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240BOOKING\056booking\137id\056\nweight\137kg\240\050DECIMAL\051 \055 Total baggage mass in kilograms\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of registration\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056)
