1012 0 obj
  << /ActualText (9\056 BAGGAGE\137CHECK\nTracks security screening and inspection results of registered luggage\056\nbaggage\137checking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique baggage check record ID\056\nbooking\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240BOOKING\056booking\137id\056\npassenger\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240PASSENGER\056passenger\137id\056\ncheck\137results\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Outcome of baggage clearance check\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of screening\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of screening update\056\n10\056 SECURITY\137CHECK\nStores physical screening and identity security check logs for passengers\056\nsecurity\137check\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 PK\051 \055 Unique security record ID\056\npassenger\137id\240\050INTEGER\054 FK\051 \055 Foreign key referencing\240PASSENGER\056passenger\137id\056\ncheck\137results\240\050VARCHAR\051 \055 Outcome of passenger security screening\056\ncreated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of inspection\056\nupdated\137at\240\050TIMESTAMP\051 \055 Timestamp of last update\056\n5\056 Relationships and Cardinalities Summary\nAIRLINE \055\076 FLIGHT \0501\072N\051\072\240One airline operates multiple scheduled flights\056\nAIRPORT \055\076 FLIGHT \0501\072N\051\072\240An airport can be designated as the departure airport \050departure\137airport\137id\051 or arrival airport \050arrival\137airport\137id\051 for multiple flights\056\nFLIGHT \055\076 BOOKING \0501\072N\051\072\240A single scheduled flight can have multiple passenger bookings\056\nPASSENGER \055\076 BOOKING \0501\072N\051\072\240A single passenger can make multiple flight bookings over time\056\nBOOKING \055\076 BOARDING\137PASS \0501\0720\056\0561\051\072\240Each valid booking generates at most one boarding pass upon check\055in\056\nBOOKING \055\076 BAGGAGE \0501\072N\051\072\240A booking record can include zero or several pieces of registered luggage\056\nBOOKING \055\076 BOOKING\137CHANGES\137HISTORY \0501\072N\051\072\240A booking can accumulate multiple revision logs if modifications occur\056\nBOOKING \046 PASSENGER \055\076 BAGGAGE\137CHECK \0501\072N\051\072\240Baggage inspections relate to specific passenger profiles and their flight bookings\056\nPASSENGER \055\076 SECURITY\137CHECK \0501\072N\051\072\240Passengers undergo airport security clearance steps\054 generating historical inspection logs)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 1013 0 R
     /Pg 937 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
